SUMMARY:Welcome Lounge (Day 2)
DESCRIPTION:At the Welcome Lounge (Tsang Shiu Tim Art Hall) collect your we
 lcome package - insurance certificate\, Non-local Student Pocket Guide\, I
 nternational SOS Information Sheet\, International SOS Membership Card\, E
 mergency Card\, and your Welcome Reception entry pass - plus a welcome gif
 t. Sign up for a campus tour\, meet your HKUST Exchange Buddies\, and ask 
 any questions. Service hours: 27 Aug 14:00-17:00\; 28 Aug 09:30-11:30.
LOCATION:Tsang Shiu Tim Art Hall
END:VEVENT
